  "title": "Every Purchase Feeds a Rescued Kitten 😺",
  "bodyText": "I bought this shirt because I thought it was cute.\nThen I found out it helped feed abandoned cats.\nThat’s when it stopped feeling like just a shirt.\nMy name is Martha. I’ve loved cats my whole life, but I never realized how many of them are out there with no warm home, no full bowl, and nobody coming back for them.\nSo when I saw this tee, I smiled at the design first.\nThen I read the mission.\nEvery order helps provide meals for cats who were left behind.\nNot a vague “we care about animals” promise.\nActual food. Actual cats. Actual bowls being filled.\nThat’s why I ordered one.\nAnd honestly, now every time I wear it, people ask where I got it.\nI tell them:\n“It’s not just a cat shirt. It helps feed them too.”\nIf you’re a cat mom, this is one of those little things that actually feels good to buy.\nCute enough to wear.\nMeaningful enough to matter.\nSupport them.\nLink below.",
